title ALES191 — Lotus's stereo_reverb_preset: the named rooms carried across a stereo master, ALES190's OWN banks run through ALES189's stereo_reverb_ms — one bank definition, two faces
prompt Continue the recursion loop on the ALES / Lotus edge, Lindy-first crux-first; approve the design round, make progress, send each finished increment to origin and xykj61; stop at custody gates.
think ALES190 gave the MONO timed reverb a musician's face — three named rooms (room · hall · plate), each a curated bank run through reverb_ms — yet a keeper mixing a stereo master still had to hand ALES189's stereo_reverb_ms a whole bank by hand. The named-room comfort stopped at mono. ALES190's own recommend named the thin twin next: the same banks through the stereo timed reverb. By Lindy-first crux-first this is the highest-Lindy tractable move — it completes the named-room face across both timed reverbs, read for years by anyone reaching for a room.
think The crux held: A STEREO PRESET IS EXACTLY ITS NAMED BANK, and the bank is ALES190's OWN. Rather than redefine the three rooms, stereo_reverb_preset imports reverb_preset.Room and reverb_preset.bank_for — the exact published banks the mono preset and its witness already read — and delegates to stereo_reverb_ms UNCHANGED. One bank definition, two faces: the mono and stereo presets are provably the same rooms, and a future tuning of `hall` moves both at once. No new arithmetic on the audio path, no new fault: StereoReverbPresetError = stereo_reverb_time.StereoReverbTimeError forwarded whole.
think Five laws witnessed on a 1024-sample bench (the room a long strong hall decays in, per ALES190's fixed clip) with two DISTINCT impulses so no crossing can hide: (1) a stereo preset equals stereo_reverb_ms over that room's published bank byte for byte on BOTH channels, for all three rooms; (2) the rooms genuinely differ; (3) the image is held — a centred master stays identical channel-to-channel (one shared bank) while a stereo master keeps its channels distinct; (4) the channels leave balanced and silence stays silence; (5) the faults forward — a span past the clip DurationTooLong, an out-of-range span BadRange, both channels untouched.
obs GREEN on the FIRST metal pass — no RED to book. TAME bans clean, width exit 0, and both neighbours re-proven beside it (ALES190 mono preset GREEN, ALES189 timed stereo reverb GREEN). Purely local: one StereoClip of i16 PCM, a validated clock, ALES190's three fixed compile-time banks each within max_stages, siloed to lotus/; the room names a keeper's word for a tuning, not a claim about any real hall; no socket, network, keys, funds, device, or speaker — no custody gate reached, a self-approved design round.
